---
layout: changelog
title: "Match requests by city, ISP, and connection type with Premium Geo DB"
date: 2026-09-29
cover: /images/blog/announcing-premium-geo-db/cover.avif
tags: firewall, security, console, api
---

[Premium Geo DB](/docs/advanced/billing/premium-geo-db) is now available as a project add-on on Appwrite Cloud. It adds city, state, postal code, coordinates, time zone, ISP, AS number, and connection type to the IP lookup Appwrite runs on every request, on top of the country data every plan already gets.

With the add-on, Firewall gets 13 more condition attributes and a preset that denies API traffic from hosting networks. The project **Usage** page breaks requests down by city and network, and `locale.get()` returns the city, time zone, ISP, and AS number to your client apps.

Enable it under **Settings** > **Overview** on any project in a Pro or Scale organization. It costs $10 per project per month, prorated for the first billing cycle.

